{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33923","headline":"陈先辈故居 · 皮日休","name":"陈先辈故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杉桂交阴一里余，逢人浑似洞天居。\n千株橘树唯沽酒，十顷莲塘不买鱼。\n藜杖闲来侵径竹，角巾端坐满楼书。\n襄阳无限烟霞地，难觅幽奇似此殊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}